      <span class="search-hit">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2602.21611v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> (LLMs) have demonstrated significant potential as autonomous software engineering (SWE) agents. Recent work has further explored augmenting these agents with memory mechanisms to support long-horizon reasoning. However, these approaches typically operate at a coarse instance granularity, treating&hellip;
