        Mechanistically Guided LoRA Improves Paraphrase Consistency in Medical Vision-Language Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sadanandan%2C+B">Binesh Sadanandan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Behzadan%2C+V">Vahid Behzadan</a>
      
