        Frayed RoPE and Long Inputs: A Geometric Perspective
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wertheimer%2C+D">Davis Wertheimer</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+A">Aozhong Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+D">Derrick Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yin%2C+P">Penghang Yin</a>, 
      
