        Beyond Subtokens: A Rich Character Embedding for Low-resource and Morphologically Complex Languages
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Schneider%2C+F">Felix Schneider</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gogolev%2C+M">Maria Gogolev</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sickert%2C+S">Sven Sickert</a>, 
      
