        823-OLT @ BUET DL Sprint 4.0: Context-Aware Windowing for ASR and Fine-Tuned Speaker Diarization in Bengali Long Form Audio
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dhar%2C+R">Ratnajit Dhar</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mallik%2C+A">Arpita Mallik</a>
      
