        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.20662">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2602.20662">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2602.20662">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
