        AIForge-Doc: A Benchmark for Detecting AI-Forged Tampering in Financial and Form Documents
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+J">Jiaqi Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhou%2C+Y">Yuchen Zhou</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xu%2C+M">Muduo Xu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liang%2C+Z">Zisheng Liang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ren%2C+S">Simiao Ren</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xue%2C+J">Jiayu Xue</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+M">Meige Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+S">Siying Chen</a>, 
      
